Package: BrazilianLegislativeAnalytics
Type: Framework
Title: Brazilian Legislative Dataset Analytics Framework
Version: 1.0.0
Date: 2025-07-26
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brazilian Legislative Analytics", "Framework Team", 
           email = "analytics@framework.br", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: A comprehensive R analytical framework for processing, analyzing, 
    and visualizing Brazilian legislative data from the LexML portal. Converts 
    150k+ legislative documents from CSV to optimized Parquet format and provides 
    advanced text mining, temporal analysis, network analysis, and geospatial 
    analytics capabilities. Designed for academic research and policy analysis 
    with focus on reproducibility and performance.
